Feature: DeleteTopics validates names UUIDs duplicates and authorized identity collisions
  Scenario Outline: Invalid identity rows are excluded once each while authorized aliases remain private
    Given DeleteTopics uses <format> rows <request> and denies names <denied>
    When deletion resolves topic identities and rejects names also supplied by authorized UUID
    Then the ordered deletable topic identities are <topics>
    And the ordered invalid deletion rows are <invalid>
    Examples:
      | format | request                                                                                                     | denied | topics                                      | invalid                                                                                           |
      | UUID   | orders/zero;null/other                                                                                       | none   | orders/name/zero;null/id/other               | none                                                                                              |
      | UUID   | null/zero                                                                                                   | none   | none                                        | null/zero/no-name-or-id                                                                            |
      | UUID   | orders/orders                                                                                               | none   | none                                        | orders/orders/name-and-id                                                                          |
      | UUID   | empty/orders                                                                                                | none   | none                                        | empty/orders/name-and-id                                                                           |
      | UUID   | empty/zero                                                                                                  | none   | empty/name/zero                             | none                                                                                              |
      | UUID   | orders/zero;orders/zero;orders/zero                                                                          | none   | none                                        | orders/zero/duplicate-name                                                                         |
      | legacy | orders,other,orders                                                                                         | none   | other/name/zero                             | orders/zero/duplicate-name                                                                         |
      | UUID   | b/zero;null/other;a/zero;null/orders;b/zero;null/other;a/zero;c/zero;null/orders;b/zero                        | none   | c/name/zero                                 | b/zero/duplicate-name;a/zero/duplicate-name;null/other/duplicate-id;null/orders/duplicate-id            |
      | UUID   | null/orders;null/orders                                                                                     | none   | none                                        | null/orders/duplicate-id                                                                           |
      | UUID   | null/orders;orders/zero                                                                                     | none   | none                                        | orders/orders/name-of-id                                                                           |
      | UUID   | null/orders;orders/zero;null/orders                                                                         | none   | none                                        | null/orders/duplicate-id;orders/orders/name-of-id                                                  |
      | UUID   | null/orders;orders/zero                                                                                     | orders | orders/id/orders;orders/name/zero           | none                                                                                              |
